{
  "title": "VPN / Direct Connect · SAA-C03 개념 위키",
  "description": "사내 네트워크와 AWS를 VPN 또는 전용 연결로 이어줍니다.",
  "main": "<nav aria-label=\"현재 위치\" class=\"breadcrumb\"><a href=\"/concepts/\">개념 위키</a><span aria-hidden=\"true\">/</span><span>VPN <span class=\"full-name\">(Virtual Private Network)</span> / Direct Connect</span></nav><div class=\"wiki-layout\"><aside class=\"wiki-toc\"><details open=\"\"><summary>이 문서의 목차</summary><nav aria-label=\"문서 목차\"><ol><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/hybrid/#overview\">개요</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/hybrid/#guide-1\">VPN과 Direct Connect의 차이</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/hybrid/#guide-2\">보안과 장애 대응 설계</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/hybrid/#visual\">구성 한눈에 보기</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/hybrid/#scenario\">적용 예시</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/hybrid/#notes\">각주</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/hybrid/#references\">AWS 공식 문서</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/hybrid/#practice\">연관 문제 5개</a></li></ol></nav></details><a class=\"back-index\" href=\"/concepts/\">← 전체 개념 보기</a></aside><div class=\"wiki-main\"><article class=\"term-article\"><header class=\"article-header\"><div class=\"term-meta\"><span>네트워크</span><span>60 / 62</span></div><h1>VPN <span class=\"full-name\">(Virtual Private Network)</span> / Direct Connect</h1></header><section class=\"overview\" id=\"overview\"><h2>개요</h2><p>하이브리드 네트워크는 <strong>사내 시스템과 AWS의 네트워크를 연결해 함께 사용하는 구성</strong>입니다. 대표적인 연결 방식으로 Site-to-Site VPN과 Direct Connect가 있습니다.</p><p>연결을 얼마나 빨리 준비해야 하는지, 통신 품질과 처리량이 어느 정도 필요한지, 암호화가 필요한지를 기준으로 선택합니다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section concept-guide\" id=\"guide-1\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"site-to-site-vpn\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"customer-gateway-and-virtual-private-gateway\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"direct-connect\"></span><h2>VPN과 Direct Connect의 차이</h2><p><strong>Site-to-Site VPN</strong>은 인터넷을 통해 IPsec 터널<sup><a aria-label=\"각주 1\" class=\"concept-note-ref\" href=\"#note-1\" id=\"note-ref-1\" role=\"doc-noteref\">[1]</a></sup>을 구성합니다. 사내의 고객 게이트웨이 장비와 AWS의 가상 프라이빗 게이트웨이 또는 Transit Gateway 등을 연결합니다.</p><p><strong>Direct Connect</strong>는 사내망과 AWS 사이에 전용 네트워크 연결을 제공합니다. 연결 준비에 통신사나 연결 위치의 구성이 필요하며, 인터넷 기반 연결과 다른 품질·용량 요구에 맞춰 사용합니다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section concept-guide\" id=\"guide-2\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"dedicated-and-hosted-connections\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"public-private-and-transit-vif\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"direct-connect-gateway\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"encryption-and-resilience\"></span><h2>보안과 장애 대응 설계</h2><p>전용 연결 자체가 모든 구간의 암호화를 의미하지는 않습니다. 데이터 보호가 필요하면 지원되는 암호화 방식이나 VPN을 함께 검토합니다.</p><p>한 연결의 장애에 대비해 독립된 연결과 경로를 구성합니다. VPC와 사내망의 주소 중복, 양방향 라우팅, DNS 이름 해석도 확인합니다.</p></section><section class=\"visual\" id=\"visual\"><figure class=\"diagram concept-diagram\"><figcaption><b>사내망과 AWS 연결</b></figcaption><div class=\"diagram-body\"><ol class=\"concept-flow\"><li><strong>사내 네트워크</strong><span>업무 시스템·연결 장비</span></li><li><strong>연결 방식</strong><span>VPN 또는 Direct Connect</span></li><li><strong>AWS 네트워크</strong><span>VPC·Transit Gateway</span></li></ol><p class=\"diagram-note\">연결 경로뿐 아니라 암호화, 장애 시 대체 경로, 양쪽 주소 계획을 함께 정합니다.</p></div></figure></section><section class=\"scenario\" id=\"scenario\"><h2>적용 예시</h2><p>먼저 VPN으로 사내 시스템과 AWS를 연결해 검증합니다. 지속적인 대량 통신이 필요하면 Direct Connect를 준비하고 독립된 장애 대응 경로를 추가합니다.</p></section><section class=\"concept-notes\" id=\"notes\" role=\"doc-endnotes\"><h2>각주</h2><ol><li id=\"note-1\"><strong>IPsec 터널</strong> — IP 네트워크를 통해 주고받는 트래픽을 인증하고 암호화하는 연결입니다. Site-to-Site VPN은 이 터널로 사내망과 AWS 사이의 통신을 보호합니다. <a aria-label=\"각주 1의 본문으로 돌아가기\" class=\"concept-note-back\" href=\"#note-ref-1\">↩</a></li></ol></section><section class=\"references\" id=\"references\"><h2>AWS 공식 문서</h2><ol><li id=\"reference-1\"><a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/vpn/latest/s2svpn/VPC_VPN.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">What is AWS Site-to-Site VPN? ↗</a></li><li id=\"reference-2\"><a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/whitepapers/latest/aws-vpc-connectivity-options/aws-direct-connect.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">AWS Direct Connect ↗</a></li></ol></section></article><section class=\"related-questions\" id=\"practice\"><div class=\"section-heading\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">PRACTICE · ENGLISH</p><h2>연관 문제 5개</h2></div><a href=\"/concepts/quiz/q020/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"0\" data-question=\"Q020\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q020\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q020</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q020/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A company wants a central hub to connect dozens of VPCs and on-premises networks. Which service is most appropriate?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q020\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">AWS Transit Gateway</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q020\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon EBS</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q020\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon SNS</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q020\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">An AMI</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 A</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/tgw/\">Transit Gateway</a>가 다수 네트워크의 중앙 연결과 라우팅에 적합하다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/tgw/\">Transit Gateway</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/hybrid/\">VPN / Direct Connect</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"2\" data-question=\"Q021\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q021\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q021</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q021/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A company needs a dedicated network connection from its premises to AWS and will handle encryption separately. Which service should it consider?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q021\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">S3 One Zone-IA</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q021\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Route 53 TTL settings</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q021\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">AWS Direct Connect</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q021\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">CloudFront caching</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 C</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/hybrid/\">Direct Connect</a>는 전용 네트워크 연결이다. 전송 암호화는 별도 방식을 설계해야 한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/hybrid/\">VPN / Direct Connect</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"2\" data-question=\"Q022\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q022\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q022</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q022/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A company wants to quickly establish an encrypted tunnel between its on-premises network and AWS over the internet. Which service should it choose?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q022\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">AWS CloudFormation</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q022\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon FSx</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q022\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">AWS Site-to-Site VPN</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q022\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon EFS</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 C</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/hybrid/#site-to-site-vpn\">Site-to-Site VPN</a>이 IPsec 터널을 제공한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/hybrid/\">VPN / Direct Connect</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/vpc/\">VPC</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"1\" data-question=\"Q094\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q094\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q094</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q094/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">One VPC uses 10.0.0.0/16 and a VPC it must connect to uses 10.0.1.0/24. What prevents VPC peering between them?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q094\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">The presence of route tables</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q094\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">The CIDR ranges overlap</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q094\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">The VPCs are in different AZs</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q094\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Each VPC has an ENI</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 B</strong> · 겹치는 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/subnet/\">CIDR</a>은 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/vpc/\">VPC</a> <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/peering/\">피어링</a> 연결에 사용할 수 없다. 주소 계획부터 바꿔야 한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/vpc/\">VPC</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/peering/\">VPC Peering</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/subnet/\">Subnet / CIDR</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"1\" data-question=\"Q019\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q019\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q019</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q019/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">VPC A is peered with VPC B, and VPC B is peered with VPC C. Can A reach C through B using these peering connections?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q019\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Yes, if A's security group allows it</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q019\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">No. VPC peering does not support transitive routing</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q019\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Yes, if B has a NAT gateway</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q019\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Yes, by default</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 B</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/vpc/\">VPC</a> <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/peering/\">피어링</a>은 비전이적이다. 별도 연결이나 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/tgw/\">Transit Gateway</a>를 설계한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/peering/\">VPC Peering</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/tgw/\">Transit Gateway</a></div></article></section><nav aria-label=\"용어 이동\" class=\"sequence\"><span><a href=\"/concepts/terms/peering/\">이전 용어 <b>VPC Peering</b></a></span><span><a href=\"/concepts/terms/waf/\">다음 용어 <b>WAF / Shield</b></a></span></nav></div></div>"
}
